# src/app/(auth) (bridge)

- Routes stay here; do not relocate out of `src/app`.
- Helpers: `modules/auth/` + `infra/auth/` + `infra/email/`.
- Rules: `module-auth.mdc`, `infra.mdc`.
- Actions: `src/actions/auth.ts`, `invite.ts`, `onboarding-entry.ts`.
